# Provenance artefacts are not committed. The PDFs and pinned repository tarballs
# preserved here are large (about 19M) and are reproducible from the URLs, DOIs,
# arXiv IDs and commit SHAs recorded against each card in ../MANIFEST.md.
#
# The JSON lists ARE committed. They are the substance of the antislop-sampler
# source, not a copy of a document that describes it, so a card citing them needs
# them present to be checkable.
*
!.gitignore
!*.json
